# Choose exactly one purpose-specific template; keep the private result outside Git.
# Local development: cp infra/env/local.env.example .env.local
# Synthetic tests: infra/env/test.env.example
# Staging: infra/env/staging.env.example
# Production: infra/production/env/{web,backend,admin}.env.example
# Full instructions: docs/development.md and infra/production/README.md.
